§§ `Article 2 of the decision — in effect from signing`

-- src:32 | Điều 2. Quyết định này có hiệu lực kể từ ngày ký.
-- "From the date of signing". The signing date is not stated separately; the decision is
-- dated 22 May 2024 and signed on its face, so this encoding takes that date (fork F1).
-- NOTHING in the decision or the rules says when they cease to have effect or what replaces
-- them; a later decision that replaces them is outside this document and is not encoded.
@ref Decision 53/2024/QD-BH Tasco, Article 2 (src:32), dated on page 1 (src:4, page-read)
GIVETH A DATE
`the date the rules took effect` MEANS YMD 2024 5 22

@ref Decision 53/2024/QD-BH Tasco, Article 2 (src:32)
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rules had taken effect on` `the day` MEANS
    `the day` AT LEAST `the date the rules took effect`

