-- src:92 | giữa Bên mua bảo hiểm và Bảo hiểm Tasco chịu sự điều chỉnh của Luật Kinh doanh Bảo hiểm
-- src:93 | và Quy tắc này.
-- "Together with the proposal and/or the premium paid": the certificate evidences the contract
-- when Tasco issued it and at least one of the two accompanies it.
@ref Rules, Phần I, definition 10 (src:90-93)
GIVEN `Tasco issued the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there is a proposal` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the premium was paid` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the certificate evidences the contract` `Tasco issued the certificate` `there is a proposal` `the premium was paid` MEANS
        `Tasco issued the certificate`
    AND (`there is a proposal` OR `the premium was paid`)

§§ `11 Preserving the right of claim ("Bảo lưu quyền khiếu nại")`

